  <is>
    A website page for libraries and packages
  </is>
  <documentation>
    Structuring skeleton for the “Libraries and packages” documentation page. Planned scopes: Library publishable unit, packages, domain bml package convention. Purpose and detailLevel are derived from the a01 BmlDocSetPlan PagePlan docs.LibrariesAndPackages. This skeleton carries page identity, properties, and authoritative-source references only; sections and prose are authored in the a03 stage.
  </documentation>
